    "regime_notes": "Full-history admission passes at 10D and 20D. 10D regime IC: 2020-22 0.00929, 2023-25 0.03576, 2026-27 0.07467, 2028-30 0.01940, 2031 YTD -0.01836. Recent 120 IC -0.03023 and ICIR -0.12331 indicate material current drift; use conservatively and revalidate promptly.",
